{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_17043.jpg","bgm":"stop","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm01_anime03","chara":[{"id":301801,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"这个给你…","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":104401}],"nameNarration":"命","narration":"吃完一起做的饭菜之后@小帆奈马上就说要回家","narrationBg":"bg_adv_17043.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"narration":"在送她回去的路上@小帆奈就像拿出弄丢的东西一样@递给了我一本笔记本"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"命","narrationEffect":"out","textLeft":"这是…？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"是日记本…"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"日记本？@诶，莫非是…"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"motion":400}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"那种互相交换的日记！？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":400}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"是啊…不行吗？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"倒、倒也不是，但为什么？@我还以为小帆奈讨厌这种东西…"},{"chara":[{"id":301801,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"只是为了共享魔女之类的情报@而已…没有别的意思"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"诶～…哼～…"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"…嘛，如果有什么想法@顺便写下来不也挺好的吗？"},{"chara":[{"id":301801}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"我们姑且也是搭档…"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"小帆奈…@我好高兴！我一辈子都会珍藏的！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":400}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"[chara:301801:effect_emotion_surprise_0][se:7226_shock]不…你听我说话了吗？@倒是好好写啊"},{"autoTurnLast":1,"bg":"bg_adv_24014.jpg","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"虽然总感觉有点害羞@但我们就这样开始交换日记了","narrationBg":"bg_adv_24014.jpg","narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":1.2,"bg":"bg_adv_21221.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"给，我写好了哦小帆奈！","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":301801,"motion":400}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"诶，已经写好了？@明明昨天才刚给你…"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"因为我有很多想写的嘛@没办法啦"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0},{"id":301801,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"啊，还有…作为日记本的回礼@我给你买了这个"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"item":[{"path":"resource/scenario/img/31044_mikoto_story/31044_mikoto_penset.png","posX":0,"posY":0,"visible":"appear","zOrder":"charaBack"}]},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"成对的圆珠笔！@写日记的时候就用这个吧！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":300}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"…这不是我喜欢的类型"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"诶，为什么？这不挺可爱的吗？@来，拿起来看看嘛"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"item":[{"path":"resource/scenario/img/31044_mikoto_story/31044_mikoto_penset.png","visible":"hide"}]},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"这样…？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":400,"mouthOpen":1}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"哇~，拿着精致圆珠笔的@小帆奈好可爱~！[chara:104401:mouthOpen_0]"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"…我扔了"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":200,"mouthOpen":1}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"[chara:104401:effect_emotion_surprise_0][se:7226_shock]别这样别这样！@我骗你的！[chara:104401:mouthOpen_0]"},{"autoTurnLast":0.5,"bg":"bg_adv_21221.jpg","bgm":"stop","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm03_story05","nameNarration":"命","narration":"说实话，我很迷茫@要在日记上写什么…","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21221.jpg","narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"narration":"但是，那正是我伪装了自己的证据…@因为说出无数谎言而迷失了自我@甚至都找不到应该写下的东西了"},{"narration":"但是…我注意到了"},{"narration":"如果自己迷失了自我的话@只要让其他人帮忙找回来就可以了…"},{"narration":"小帆奈…@虽然因为还没有勇气@所以还无法告诉你所有的真相"},{"narration":"但是总有一天…@如果我能做到这些就好了"},{"narration":"…我打从心底如此想道"},{"autoTurnLast":1,"bg":"bg_adv_narration.jpg","bgm":"stop","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"stop"},{"autoTurnFirst":4.4,"chara":[{"id":104401,"motion":300,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_1044_00_04"}],"nameCenter":"命","textCenter":"但是，我所映出的@只有虚假的世界","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnFirst":2,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":104401}]},{"chara":[{"id":104401}]},{"autoTurnLast":2,"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"}]},"version":3}